            <title>2.39.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:33:50 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>126</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.39.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Creating a worktree from the launcher copies the repository's ignored build artifacts much faster. The "Copying Build Files…" step now calls APFS `clonefile(2)` directly instead of running `cp` once per ignored entry — a 132 GB / 100,000-file tree clones in under 3 seconds, where the old path took 20 seconds on the same repository. Disk usage is unchanged: the copy is still copy-on-write, so it costs only metadata until the files diverge.
]]></description>
