            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The live mirror now sends the session's status bar — branch and context meter — to clients that ask for it. Canopy for iPhone draws it under the live page, and a Mac attached to another Mac's session shows it in its mirror pane, matching the origin's own bar.
]]></description>
